{"schema_version":2,"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","events":[{"id":"zongshi-e-o070","title":"时太常潘濬掌荆州事，重安长陈留舒燮有罪下狱；濬尝失燮，欲置之于法；论者多为有言，濬犹不释","accounts":[{"id":"zongshi-a-a4ec7370c6744a425eba","label":"正文","text":"时太常潘濬掌荆州事，重安长陈留舒燮有罪下狱；濬尝失燮，欲置之于法；论者多为有言，濬犹不释","evidence":["zongshi-q-c80c69f354b64a3ac484"]},{"id":"zongshi-a-4a318cef716337f1c834","label":"正文","text":"邻谓濬曰：舒伯膺兄弟争死海内义之，仲膺又有奉国旧意；今君杀其子弟，若天下一统、青盖北巡，中州士人必问仲膺继嗣，答者云潘承明杀燮，于事何如？濬意即解，燮用得济","evidence":["zongshi-q-c67b85ea036da0abf8e5"]}],"participants":[{"person":"wuzhu-p0065","role":"欲置燮于法者；意解者","evidence":["zongshi-q-c80c69f354b64a3ac484","zongshi-q-c67b85ea036da0abf8e5"]},{"person":"zongshi-p0046","role":"下狱者；得济者","evidence":["zongshi-q-c80c69f354b64a3ac484","zongshi-q-c67b85ea036da0abf8e5"]},{"person":"zongshi-p0035","role":"进言救燮者","evidence":["zongshi-q-c67b85ea036da0abf8e5"]}],"place":null,"time":{"label":"年代未详","precision":"undated","basis":"原文时间表达；各账户以所引文献为准。","evidence":["zongshi-q-c80c69f354b64a3ac484","zongshi-q-c67b85ea036da0abf8e5"]},"ordering_evidence":"zongshi-q-c80c69f354b64a3ac484","source_order":[51,112,0],"order":9170}],"persons":[{"id":"zongshi-p0046","name":"舒燮","evidence":["zongshi-q-c80c69f354b64a3ac484","zongshi-q-c67b85ea036da0abf8e5"],"facts":[],"aliases":[],"mentions":[]}],"evidence":[{"id":"zongshi-q-c67b85ea036da0abf8e5","section":"chapter-051","block":"b-746c844ffff04c7b5221","layer":"original","quote":"邻谓濬曰：“舒伯膺兄弟争死〖7〗，海内义之，以为美谈；仲膺又有奉国旧意〖8〗。今君杀其子弟，若天下一统，青盖北巡〖9〗；中州士人必问仲膺继嗣〖10〗，答者云‘潘承明杀燮〖11〗’，于事何如？”濬意即解，燮用得济","section_title":"宗室传第六","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0109.xhtml","index":111,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":57,"end":162,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"zongshi-q-c80c69f354b64a3ac484","section":"chapter-051","block":"b-746c844ffff04c7b5221","layer":"original","quote":"时太常潘濬掌荆州事〖3〗，重安长陈留舒燮有罪下狱〖4〗；濬尝失燮〖5〗，欲置之于法〖6〗。论者多为有言，濬犹不